    ('gymvisual:0121', 'Barbell Upright Row v. 3', NULL, 'weight_reps', 'shoulders', ARRAY['traps', 'biceps']::TEXT[], 'barbell', ARRAY['barbell']::TEXT[], 'intermediate', 'Stand with your feet shoulder-width apart and hold a barbell with an overhand grip, hands slightly wider than shoulder-width apart.
Let the barbell hang in front of your thighs, arms fully extended.
