    ('gymvisual:0318', 'Incline Dumbbell Curl', 'Incline Dumbbell Curl', 'weight_reps', 'biceps', ARRAY['forearms']::TEXT[], 'dumbbell', ARRAY['dumbbells', 'adjustable_bench']::TEXT[], 'beginner', 'Set an incline bench to a 45-degree angle and sit on it with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing forward.
