    ('gymvisual:0350', 'Dumbbell Lying Supine Curl', NULL, 'weight_reps', 'biceps', ARRAY['forearms']::TEXT[], 'dumbbell', ARRAY['dumbbells', 'flat_bench']::TEXT[], 'beginner', 'Lie flat on a bench with a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing up and arms fully extended.
Keeping your upper arms stationary, exhale and curl the weights while contracting your biceps.
