    ('gymvisual:0368', 'Dumbbell Over Bench Revers Wrist Curl', NULL, 'weight_reps', 'forearms', ARRAY['biceps']::TEXT[], 'dumbbell', ARRAY['dumbbells', 'flat_bench']::TEXT[], 'beginner', 'Sit on a bench with your feet flat on the ground and hold a dumbbell in each hand, palms facing down.
Rest your forearms on the bench, allowing your wrists to hang off the edge.
