    ('gymvisual:1669', 'Dumbbell One Arm Seated Hammer Curl', NULL, 'weight_reps', 'biceps', ARRAY['forearms']::TEXT[], 'dumbbell', ARRAY['dumbbells', 'flat_bench']::TEXT[], 'beginner', 'Sit on a bench with your back straight and feet flat on the ground.
